[57.704285, "o", "The firewall is configured to only accept HTTP/HTTPS traffic if the packet payload contains the string \"Mozilla\". This appears to be an attempt at user-agent filtering to block non-browser traffic. However, this blocks legitimate HTTP clients like curl, wget, and automated tools that don't use \"Mozilla\" in their User-Agent headers.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
