[57.705157, "o", "WHY SSH WORKS BUT HTTP DOESN'T:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[57.705204, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[57.705492, "o", "- SSH (port 22): Rule 3 provides unconditional ACCEPT for all TCP traffic to port 22, regardless of packet content\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
