[57.707495, "o", "The string-matching rules should be removed entirely. If the goal is to restrict HTTP access, consider:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[57.70753, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[57.707712, "o", "- Using application-layer filtering (e.g., mod_security, WAF)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
